. Makoto and his allies engage in life-or-death battles with Shadows in order to end the Dark Hour. Through the battles, some must face the deaths of friends and family, some must notice what precious things must be protected, and some must find meaning in the battles that have occurred.  In front of Makoto, the mysterious transfer student Ryoji Mochizuki appears. When the group greets a new morning, the gears of fate begin to turn. A fight revolving around each of the heroes' bonds begins...","tagline":"Death takes many forms."},{"language":"ja-JP","overview":"理たち特別課外活動部はついに最後の大型シャドウを撃破する。情報によると、これで影時間も、そこに立つタルタロスの塔も消滅するはずだった。だが、戦いの終結に安堵する面々の期待をよそに、再び影時間は訪れる。困惑する一同がタルタロスに駆けつけると、そこには幾月理事長とアイギスがいた。明かされる衝撃の事実と訪れる悲劇、戦う理由を見失う仲間たち。その翌週、ふさぎ込む理の前に、謎めいた転校生・望月が現われる。","tagline":"時は待たない。すべてを等しく、終わりへと運んでゆく。"}],"images":{"logos":[{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/26jiyex8HkRWoxwW2uYApzsXlNt.svg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/26jiyex8HkRWoxwW2uYApzsXlNt.svg","language":"ja","width":400,"height":200},{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/oifZpuOjyOwNzIcVzT9eBIANLSV.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/oifZpuOjyOwNzIcVzT9eBIANLSV.png","language":"ja","width":1576,"height":850},{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/3ou1mm1AQob5cyGPmwvQxUdxCud.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/3ou1mm1AQob5cyGPmwvQxUdxCud.png","language":"ja","width":1146,"height":587}],"posters":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/nU8xSwOj2UKt3IYGkjEA8k6ccw3.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/nU8xSwOj2UKt3IYGkjEA8k6ccw3.jpg","language":"en","width":608,"height":860},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/aInIVoNe5j1ji0YCjqWCs3XZzm7.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/aInIVoNe5j1ji0YCjqWCs3XZzm7.jpg","language":"en","width":666,"height":900},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/gpG8zkOIVhLWup6QQxUEUX8X0fQ.jpg",